Green Vibe integrates Numérique Responsable (responsible digital) practices
into the Mistral Vibe coding agent.

Rule content is an original rewrite authored for Green Vibe, derived from:
- Green Claude (https://github.com/Institut-du-Numerique-Responsable/green-claude)
- Green Codex  (https://github.com/Institut-du-Numerique-Responsable/green-codex)
both by the Institut du Numérique Responsable.

Rule sheets record their per-rule origin ("origin" field) and the official
referential they relate to, when one applies ("rgesn" field). Identifiers
NR-* are Green Vibe project identifiers, not official criterion numbers.
